    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Murphy lives at a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bird sanctuary",
            "zh": "保护区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Missouri, U.S.A. In early March, the 31-year-old male "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bald eagle",
            "zh": "白头海雕"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " started spending all day sitting on a nest he had carefully "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This was not unusual in "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", as male bald eagles always help females during the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hatching",
            "ref": "v-hatch"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of eggs. But there was something different about Murphy’s situation—there was no "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in his nest at all. Surprisingly, he was trying to hatch a rock he had "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Over the next few weeks, Murphy became more and more protective of his “egg”. He would loudly shout at other bald eagles if they came too "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to his nest. Sometimes, he even stood up to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the rock underneath him. The caretakers grew concerned about his "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " behaviour. To protect him and other eagles, they had to move Murphy to a separate, quieter area on April 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "That same week, a real baby eagle arrived at the sanctuary. It had "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " its parents during a heavy storm and needed care. The caretakers thought carefully and decided to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the little eaglet with Murphy. Guess what happened next? Murphy immediately stopped sitting on his rock. He no longer showed "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in it. Instead, he began to gently take care of the baby eagle, feeding and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "guarding",
            "ref": "v-guard"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it as if it were his own baby! It turned out to be a perfect match for both."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
